      text: 'JPfile:///Users/miguelgarglez/Developer/hackathon-tdots/challenge-banana-candidateP\n\n[/Users/miguelgarglez/Developer/hackathon-tdots/challenge-banana-candidate/docs/contracts.md\n\n[/Users/miguelgarglez/Developer/hackathon-tdots/challenge-banana-candidate/docs/challenge.md\n\nY__skill_reminder__:/Users/miguelgarglez/.claude/skills/typescript-best-practices/SKILL.md\n\na/Users/miguelgarglez/Developer/hackathon-tdots/challenge-banana-candidate/src/banking/dispatch.ts\n\nf/Users/miguelgarglez/Developer/hackathon-tdots/challenge-banana-candidate/src/banking/authorization.ts\n\n`/Users/miguelgarglez/Developer/hackathon-tdots/challenge-banana-candidate/src/banking/actions.ts\n\n_/Users/miguelgarglez/Developer/hackathon-tdots/challenge-banana-candidate/src/banking/client.ts\n\nZ/Users/miguelgarglez/Developer/hackathon-tdots/challenge-banana-candidate/src/agent/run.ts\n\n\\/Users/miguelgarglez/Developer/hackathon-tdots/challenge-banana-candidate/src/agent/tools.ts\n\n]/Users/miguelgarglez/Developer/hackathon-tdots/challenge-banana-candidate/src/agent/prompt.ts\n\nU/Users/miguelgarglez/Developer/hackathon-tdots/challenge-banana-candidate/src/auth.ts\n\nd/Users/miguelgarglez/Developer/hackathon-tdots/challenge-banana-candidate/app/api/[...path]/route.ts\n\na/Users/miguelgarglez/Developer/hackathon-tdots/challenge-banana-candidate/src/operator/copilot.ts\n\nZ/Users/miguelgarglez/Developer/hackathon-tdots/challenge-banana-candidate/src/telemetry.ts\n\n^/Users/miguelgarglez/Developer/hackathon-tdots/challenge-banana-candidate/src/operator/view.ts\n\nQ\nI/Users/miguelgarglez/Developer/hackathon-tdots/challenge-banana-candidate\n\n$98da2381-82f4-4403-a318-97486132853f',
